# Trivy findings accepted for now. The trivy job still blocks on every High
# and Critical finding not listed here.
# Each entry needs: a CVE id, a one-line reason, an issue link and an expiry
# date, as comment lines directly above the id. Entries past their expiry are
# removed.
# Example (not active):
#   # Reason: no fixed version exists. Issue: <link>. Expires: 2026-12-31.
#   CVE-0000-00000
